{"title":"1998 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The pie chart shows a percentage breakdown of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> votes in a student election. How many votes did Sue receive?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db42d615d89167dca6c5e29ab08d0601136d411d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 550 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 350 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 330 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 450 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 935$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find the number of votes that Sue got, we can find the percentage of votes that she got, and multiply that by the total number of votes overall.\n</p><p>We can find the percentage of votes that Sue got by subtracting the percentage of votes that came from other students from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bd818354ff89f378b1c6b3d4df72f3c8c508b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f90c22323da03f0baafa3b40a0ee528ad1de767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - (45\\% + 20\\%) = 100\\% - 65\\% = 35\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"349\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>We then get that the number of votes that Sue got is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fcc40a4a1199d2405b1fccd8c4d24206472f9d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35\\% \\times 1000 = 0.35 \\times 1000 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 350}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"307\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find the number of votes that Sue got, we can subtract the votes that the other students got, and subtract it from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Jim got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12db6c292127cf1120c537666b630082b140aecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\% \\times 1000 = 0.20 \\times 1000 = 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"260\" height=\"17\" /> votes.\n</p><p>Jane got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5614342dd41fb7702aa53fd69174a72799c6994d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45\\% \\times 1000 = 0.45 \\times 1000 = 450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"260\" height=\"17\" /> votes.\n</p><p>Altogether, Jim and Jane got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/e/47e22da9f923f81ea8fc8891c6686b34ba675670.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200 + 450 = 650$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> votes.\n</p><p>Subtracting this from the total, we find that Sue got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0862cb1d33b82f8dc6565c40f98ad8ebcc59d08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000 - 650 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 350}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"185\" height=\"30\" /> votes.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:CEMC_Pascal_25p_box&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:CEMC Pascal 25p box (page does not exist)\">Template:CEMC Pascal 25p box</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191843\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 718/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2080/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.635      1 -total\n 56.54%    5.448      2 Template:Image_needed\n 24.60%    2.370      1 Template:CEMC_Pascal_25p_box\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32661:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191843 and revision id 273200. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}